{"title": "Consume Souls", "pageid": 25954, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Consume_Souls", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Consume_Souls_(explorer)\" title=\"Consume Souls (explorer)\">Consume Souls (explorer)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Consume_Souls_(tactician)\" title=\"Consume Souls (tactician)\">Consume Souls (tactician)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Consume Souls</b> is a bonus action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>, that lets him absorb <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Charges (Condition)\">souls</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Pillar_of_Souls\" title=\"Pillar of Souls\">Soul Pillars</a> to restore <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Punish Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\">Punish Divinity</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Absorb a <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Charges (Condition)\">soul</a> from each <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Pillar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Soul Pillar\">Soul Pillar</a> still standing to spend on powerful spells.\n</p>\nYour <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Punish Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\">Punish Divinity</a> is restored every time you absorb souls in this way.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 30 m (100 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 30 m (100 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Punish_Divinity\"> Condition: Punish Divinity </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Punish Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Generic_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Punish_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Punish Divinity (Condition)\">Punish Divinity</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When hit with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage, Raphael can use a reaction to stun the attacker, leaving the impudent creature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Stun_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Stun (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Wrenched\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Stun_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Stun (Condition)\">Soul Wrenched</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2500/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29528/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13448/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip rec